{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "523f5c8f26b3a71d7cc7dafa6911243d256babfd2a18542141b137fb5b6de077", "ja": "おーい、雪歩……あ、衣装のフィッティング中か。\nごめん、今ちょっといいか？", "zh": "喂──雪步……啊，你在试穿服装啊。\n抱歉，现在方便打扰你一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dd2f39dfa478d7788f42a8fc802593700588ea4e8f3a9c161adb07fccce51dd3", "ja": "ああっ！？　{$P$}……！\nうう……ご、ごめんなさいぃ～！", "zh": "啊啊！？{$P$}……！\n呜呜……对、对不起～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f69792abcf6f62a63b92f1789f72edadc6d672034a45b0ab60d12b70e7534169", "ja": "えっ！？　なんでいきなり謝るんだ？", "zh": "咦！？为什么突然道歉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "e2ad2932aa946494af1a33876612dec8302759cd3f15a783b8ff08e08c90ad96", "ja": "だ、だって、こんなに素敵な衣装が、\n本当に私に似合うかどうか、気になって……。", "zh": "因、因为我真的好在意\n这么棒的服装穿在自己身上好不好看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "12895ef737398deda8b985c9e6b46b8a0ce32a38e53523a8ebb1d9c623706854", "ja": "{$P$}に無断で、\nつい着ちゃったんですぅ。ごめんなさいぃ……！", "zh": "所以没经过{$P$}的同意\n就把服装拿来试穿了，对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ff932d5fb78ee9478be31ed10d60839e03548ec2df9a1105efcfad23420865ee", "ja": "なんだ……気にしなくていいよ、そんなの。\n雪歩のための衣装なんだから。", "zh": "这样啊……这点小事不用放在心上。\n那本来就是为雪步准备的服装嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1006_p", "source_sha256": "add4847252b3c933bf867b92ee0830a404d1f1f0f9d05930e10ee373a8132ff8", "ja": "でも、なんだか意外だな。新しい衣装を\n着ることなんて、もう慣れてるのかと思ったよ。", "zh": "不过，还真让我意外呢，\n毕竟换过这么多套服装，我还以为你已经习惯了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9b80d2d674b6eff47771de847e93e9237281ccc6ed404579e1965a329b5aa8b7", "ja": "慣れたりしませんよぉ！\n衣装をもらうときは、いつもドキドキします。", "zh": "才没有习惯呢！\n每次收到新服装时，我都紧张得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1008_004yuk", "source_sha256": "98e9d6f703ad70fa9a5cc23e37f27e9181e055d47583b95a22957c85ea7f8814", "ja": "この衣装に関わる人たちの想いとか、\n優しい気持ちが伝わってきて……。", "zh": "可以感受到服装团队的想法，\n有股温柔的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "0f871e6183a040a587655a556812a076a90f8a51be83d336242a21462bbb5f76", "ja": "うれしすぎて、胸がいっぱいになるんですぅ。\n……きっと、ずっと慣れないと思います。", "zh": "每次都让我好开心，觉得感动不已。\n……我想我永远都不会习惯的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4a1afd4e6fa178e84acab01461dabd2146226bdf19d7f10ecd64b367392b9d1c", "ja": "そうか……。\nまあとりあえず、心配いらないよ。似合ってるから。", "zh": "这样啊……\n总之别担心，因为你穿起来非常好看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "268ec1f21a941a95b4e13f37eef6115296cab5df8881a7013b1ae45697ffddba", "ja": "えっ？　……ほ、本当ですか？　えへへ♪\n怒ってるんじゃなくて、よかったですぅ……。", "zh": "咦？……真、真的吗？嘿嘿♪\n你没有生气，真是太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d9167110f7b91bcf248241a56adbada7b5b61554b7cfdf15deb5a47561c3f77d", "ja": "あの、ところで{$P$}。\n私を探してくれてたみたいですけど、なんでしょう？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，话说回来，\n你好像在找我，是有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7c11d0badc4cc02e163e2cfcd93ba4008159a406a8123951a17a0745119d86d1", "ja": "ん？　ああ、そういえば……。", "zh": "嗯？啊，对了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1014_004yuk", "source_sha256": "532b153dc8c1bba0427459e0b10fb6c6d15a55bbd6cb863a8709beda22445fbb", "ja": "衣装のことで怒ってるんじゃないなら……。\nうぅ、ほかに怒られるようなことしたかな……。", "zh": "如果不是因为服装在生气的话……\n呜呜，那是我做了其他会挨骂的事吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1015_p", "source_sha256": "eb8935ad4804d24bc6acfac956aa28a6177c5342510c5a1aacc1b1d73592a618", "ja": "なんで怒られる前提なんだ……？　違うよ。\nほら、ブログに書いてただろ、喫茶店の話。", "zh": "为什么一直以为我是来骂你的……？不是啦，\n你有在部落格上提到咖啡厅对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d50f3f433aad7cf56777a80bbf68ea948d04df2d94c2deb1a3a55122ec52cc0c", "ja": "はい。とっても素敵な喫茶店を見つけて……。\nあっ、{$P$}、もしかして……？", "zh": "嗯，我发现了一间非常棒的咖啡厅……\n啊，难不成{$P$}是要……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1017_p", "source_sha256": "add34d3fca1920e40d3136d439bb4afb3fd25aecaa4735aecc2affcee1d16ead", "ja": "うん。雪歩の文章読んでたら、気になって。\n行ってみたいから、場所を教えてほしいんだ。", "zh": "嗯，看了雪步的文章以后，我就颇感兴趣，\n想去看看，所以来问你要怎么走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1b319bc7afb42867e5ca4103825e0de57d6ddae9a9470b8a6e0c99ef18eea281", "ja": "ふふっ……♪\nわかりましたぁ！　後でメールしますね。", "zh": "呵呵……♪\n我知道了！那我待会传简讯跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b13b3e029fdb50377fb2c1440c3743fbb87eec9bd20bc797aa5ecd057c532c33", "ja": "ああ、よろしく。店名だけでもいいから。", "zh": "嗯，麻烦了，只有店名也没关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "97573783c3d39f34e726887bfd5306f8f2300ba4b73936ccc47e9c580517ca2f", "ja": "はい……あ、でも、ちょっと\nわかりにくい場所かも……。", "zh": "好的……啊，可是那间店，\n好像有点难找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1021_004yuk", "source_sha256": "68c94a43756498affe5511b7f7525f705b0bc554496f7fe7441fb2f77bd1ea8b", "ja": "……。\n……あ、あの、{$P$}！", "zh": "……\n……那、那个……{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "cdbed09d3f259dcaa28aac2c007adbab1814e4a7f29829ee2999812072a51622", "ja": "今度のお休みに、私といっ……、い……。\nあぅ……。な、何でもないですぅ。うぅ……。", "zh": "下次休假，要不要跟我一起……一起……\n啊呜……没、没事，呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1023_p", "source_sha256": "1acb70be4c5e10c15b08a4c58061b0d2545d190fe96ce22e88a0959746ada27c", "ja": "……わかりにくい場所なのか。困ったな。\nもしよかったら、案内してくれないかな？", "zh": "……不好找是吧，那还真伤脑筋。\n你方便的话，愿意带我去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "5c792591495af90953966ece0dabbafed13d9d26a3c7e188e9ff4f1f5194b026", "ja": "えっ？　は、はいっ。\n{$P$}がよければ、ぜひ！", "zh": "咦？好、好的！\n{$P$}不介意的话，我很乐意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1025_p", "source_sha256": "ef7a52f098acd6d188ee4fb6ce92c0217353cb46954738d4558f2e81a8b617d5", "ja": "じゃあ、お願いしようかな。\nわざわざごめんな。せっかくのオフなのに。", "zh": "那就麻烦你了。\n真是不好意思啊，占用你难得的假期。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "20104e2664892dbe8d300165038a060ee42513e169691e72a3e56b5355aa02fe", "ja": "大丈夫ですぅ！　ちょうど、行こうと思ってたし……。\n一緒の方が、楽しいと思うから……その……。", "zh": "没关系的！我正好也想去……\n而且有人一起去，会更开心……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1027_p", "source_sha256": "12bd22be10dd367e8b9d0a0fe81e777580a54fe61bf1008c02dc2d3e7f30d6e9", "ja": "そっか……ありがとう。\n雪歩がそう言ってくれるなら、お言葉に甘えるよ。", "zh": "这样啊……谢谢。\n既然雪步你都这么说了，那我就承蒙你的好意啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_004yuk0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_004yuk0104_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d575a707e88a482bec7e5464bfcf1e0c2e74f49603bb41bedc950913bf8e9475", "ja": "は、はい、任せてください～！\n本当にいいお店なので、期待しててくださいね♪", "zh": "好、好的，包在我身上～！\n那间店真的很棒，你就好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
